Maintainer: carlodevil <64757000+carlodevil@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: tascam-uh7000-linux
Architecture: all
Depends: udev, kmod
Recommends: alsa-utils
Description: Linux support helper for the TASCAM UH-7000 USB audio interface
 Selects the UH-7000 USB Audio 2.0 configuration on hotplug so the standard
 Linux snd_usb_audio driver can expose playback and capture devices. Includes
 a small diagnostic command, uh7000ctl.
